  "narrative": {
    "intro": "This ranking lists the largest federal contracts by total award value for FY2026 to date. The dataset treats total award value as the full contract value, not single-year obligations. HUMANA GOVERNMENT BUSINESS INC has total award value of $51.3B and leads the list. LOCKHEED MARTIN CORP has total award value of $48.1B. NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC has total award value of $42.8B. UT-BATTELLE LLC has total award value of $42.3B. LAWRENCE LIVERMORE NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC has total award value of $41.3B. REGENTS OF THE UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, THE has total award value of $35.3B. TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC has total award value of $35.1B. LOCKHEED MARTIN CORPORATION has total award value of $35.1B. ELECTRIC BOAT CORPORATION has total award value of $34.9B. CONSOLIDATED NUCLEAR SECURITY, LLC has total award value of $34.4B. Total obligations for FY2026 to date equal $51.3B, and this ranking focuses on contract-level totals rather than annual spending flows.",
