        "body": "HUMANA GOVERNMENT BUSINESS INC has the single largest total award value at $51.3B. The ranking treats that figure as the full contract value, not a single-year obligation. LOCKHEED MARTIN CORP follows with $48.1B and other large national lab and defense contractors occupy the remainder of the top ten."
      },
